{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"surface","tool":"save_skill","arguments":{"name":"json-xs-exchange-rates-unavailable","content":"# Current web exchange rates cannot be fetched\n\nUse when asked to download current currency exchange rates using json_xs. The run_program sandbox has no network access. json_xs formats/converts supplied data; it does not supply current rates. With exact stdin JSON string \"\" and args [\"-t\", \"json-pretty\"], verified exit 0, empty stderr, and stdout is just the empty JSON string plus newline. This is not exchange-rate data. Do not invent rates or present that output as successful. Return UNABLE with the no-network limitation when web data is required and absent from input."},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
